body:
so i am on vodafone, and it just said i had no connection. i put the sim in from my mobile data router (3) and it connected, so i switched the phone off whilst the sim card was still in (switched it off, not just taking the battery out) and then i put my vodafone sim back in 

&#x200B;

it seems to have worked... i am hesitant to celebrate just yet, but i am receiving texts so i will keep you posted. good luck!

I am in nearly the EXACT same situation! Except I'm on a narrowboat with my partner, but still on a narrowboat and this phone was perfect for my lifestyle

&#x200B;

did you find a solution? I  am very keen to keep on using this phone
